{"t":"AMZN","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Amazon.com, Inc.","ko":"아마존","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","employees":1638000,"hq":"Seattle, WA, United States","website":"https://www.amazon.com","summary_en":"Amazon.com, Inc. engages in the retail sale of consumer products, advertising, and subscriptions service through online and physical stores in North America and internationally. The company operates through three segments: North America, International, and Amazon Web Services (AWS). It also manufactures and sells electronic devices, including Kindle, fire tablets, fire TVs, echo, ring, blink, and eero; and develops and produces media content. In addition, the company offers programs that enable sellers to sell their products in its stores; and programs that allow authors, independent publishers, musicians, filmmakers, Twitch streamers, skill and app developers, and others to publish and sell content. Further, it provides compute, storage, Artificial intelligence, database, analytics, machine learning, and other services, as well as advertising services through programs, such as sponsored ads, display, and video advertising. Additionally, the company offers Amazon Prime, a membership program. The company's products offered through its stores include merchandise and content purchased for resale and products offered by third-party sellers. It serves consumers, sellers, developers, enterprises, content creators, advertisers, and employees. The company was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Seattle, Washington.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Amazon.com, Inc.는 북미 및 전 세계의 온라인 및 실제 매장을 통해 소비자 제품의 소매 판매, 광고 및 구독 서비스에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 북미, 국제 및 Amazon Web Services(AWS)의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 또한 Kindle, Fire 태블릿, Fire TV, 에코, 벨소리, 깜박임 및 eero를 포함한 전자 장치를 제조 및 판매합니다. 미디어 콘텐츠를 개발, 제작합니다. 또한 회사는 판매자가 매장에서 제품을 판매할 수 있는 프로그램을 제공합니다. 작가, 독립 출판사, 음악가, 영화 제작자, Twitch 스트리머, 기술 및 앱 개발자, 기타 사람들이 콘텐츠를 게시하고 판매할 수 있도록 하는 프로그램입니다. 또한 컴퓨팅, 스토리지, 인공 지능, 데이터베이스, 분석, 기계 학습 및 기타 서비스는 물론 후원 광고, 디스플레이 및 비디오 광고와 같은 프로그램을 통한 광고 서비스도 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 멤버십 프로그램인 Amazon Prime을 제공합니다. 매장을 통해 제공되는 회사의 제품에는 재판매를 위해 구매한 상품 및 콘텐츠와 제3자 판매자가 제공하는 제품이 포함됩니다. 소비자, 판매자, 개발자, 기업, 콘텐츠 제작자, 광고주 및 직원에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1994년에 설립되었으며 워싱턴주 시애틀에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":266.93,"mcap":2886350929920.0,"pe":21.57882,"fpe":24.480816,"peg":1.2034,"ps":3.619453,"pb":4.703032,"ev_ebitda":16.748,"div":0.0,"beta":1.503,"hi52":287.2,"lo52":196.0},"fin":{"rev":797455024128.0,"rev_g":0.121,"eps_g":-0.031,"gross":0.51374,"op":0.13903,"net":0.16900998,"roe":0.27416,"fcf":-34731749376.0,"cash":114226003968.0,"debt":304840998912.0,"de":49.681,"eps":12.37,"feps":10.90364},"own":{"short":0.0095,"inst":0.68845004,"insider":0.0883},"analyst":{"n":59,"mean":326.99017,"median":330.0,"high":405.0,"low":230.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.32787,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":14,"buy":44,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":16,"buy":42,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":16,"buy":43,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":16,"buy":45,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":330.0,"priorPriceTarget":255.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":352.0,"priorPriceTarget":348.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Scotiabank","ToGrade":"Sector Outperform","FromGrade":"Sector Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":300.0,"priorPriceTarget":325.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Telsey Advisory Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":335.0,"priorPriceTarget":335.0},{"GradeDate":"2